+# Version Scheme
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to number releases with Semantic Versioning (semver), using the major.minor.patch format: a major increment signals breaking changes, a minor increment signals backward-compatible features, and a patch increment signals backward-compatible bug fixes. The rationale on record is that this gives users clearer signals about compatibility and update impact when the project publishes new releases.
